tries.</p></a><div class="p-5 lg:col-span-3 border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-gray-200"><h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500 mb-3">PERFORMANCE METRICS</h4><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div class="bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded-lg"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 mb-1">Total Return</p><p class="text-xl font-bold text-green-600">+<!-- -->260.6<!-- -->%</p></div><div class="bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded-lg"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 mb-1">Annual CAGR</p><p class="text-xl font-bold text-green-600">+<!-- -->17.6<!-- -->%</p></div></div><div class="mt-3 text-xs"><div class="flex items-center justify-center p-2 rounded bg-green-50 text-green-700"><span class="font-semibold">Outperforms S&amp;P 500 by 97.6%</span></div></div></div><div class="px-4 pt-4 pb-2 md:p-5 lg:col-span-4 border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-gray-200"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3"><h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500">HISTORICAL PERFORMANCE</h4><span class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium">2017 - 2025</span></div><div class="h-32"><div class="recharts-responsive-container" style="width:100%;height:100%;min-width:0"></div></div></div><div class="p-5 lg:col-span-2 flex items-center justify-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-3 bg-blue-600 text-white text-sm font-medium rounded-md shadow-sm hover:bg-blue-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:ring-offset-2 transition-colors duration-200 w-full" href="/portfolios/DM10"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 512 512" class="mr-2" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M496 384H64V80c0-8.84-7.16-16-16-16H16C7.16 64 0 71.16 0 80v336c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h464c8.84 0 16-7.16 16-16v-32c0-8.84-7.16-16-16-16zM464 96H345.94c-21.38 0-32.09 25.85-16.97 40.97l32.4 32.4L288 242.75l-73.37-73.37c-12.5-12.5-32.76-12.5-45.25 0l-68.69 68.69c-6.25 6.25-6.25 16.38 0 22.63l22.62