ull md:w-1/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4"><div class="bg-orange-400 rounded-full w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-semibold">1</div><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Pick your strategy</h2></div><p class="text-gray-700 text-lg tracking-wide">Select a Portfolio Strategy aligned with your goals and preferences, considering factors like trading frequency and historical performance.</p></div><div class="w-full md:w-1/2"><img src="https://www.investing.com/pro/assets/www/809e6568..svg" alt="Pick your strategy" class="w-full"/></div></div><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row-reverse items-center gap-8"><div class="w-full md:w-1/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4"><div class="bg-orange-400 rounded-full w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-semibold">2</div><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Unlock the stocks</h2></div><p class="text-gray-700 text-lg tracking-wide">Add strategy-picked stocks to your portfolio. Watch for updates via email or our site to adjust holdings and stay on track for ideal performance.</p></div><div class="w-full md:w-1/2"><img src="https://www.investing.com/pro/assets/www/f5127de5..svg" alt="Unlock the stocks" class="w-full"/></div></div><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8"><div class="w-full md:w-1/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4"><div class="bg-orange-400 rounded-full w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-semibold">3</div><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Track gains over time</h2></div><p class="text-gray-700 text-lg tracking-wide">Acknowledge and celebrate achievements in your investment journey. Regularly reassess and adjust your strategy to stay on track with your financial goals.</p></div><div class="w-full md:w-1/2"><img src="https://www.investing.com/pro/assets/www/3ea4a274..svg" alt="Track gains over time" class="w-full"/></div></div></div></section><div class="p-4 md:p-8 rounded-lg mt-8 space-y-10"><h2 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl tracking-wide font-extralight">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class="mb-4 border-b border-gray-200 p-3"><div class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer"><h2 class="text-lg font">How does it work?</h2><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 512 512" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M256 217.9L383 345c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0 9.4-9.4 9.3-24.6 0-34L273 167c-9.1-9.1-23.7-9.3-33.1-.7L95 310.9c-4.7 4.7-7 10.9-7 17s2.3 12.3 7 17c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l127.1-127z"></path></svg></div><div class="overflow-hidden transition-max-height duration-[0.5s] ease-in-out max-h-96"><div class="mt-2 text-gray-700 font-light max-w-5xl"><p class="mt-2 text-gray-700 font-light">Finlo offers a high-return stock portfolios that you can easily copy. The portfolios are updated once a month, and insiders receive an update with the new stock picks before the market opens on the first trading day of the month. The portfolios typically holds ten stocks at a time, and you can use your own broker to place buy and sell orders.</p></div></div></div><div class="mb-4 border-b border-gray-200 p-3"><div class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer"><h2 class="text-lg font">Who is this for?</h2><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 512 512" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M256 294.1L383 167c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.3 24.6 0 34L273 345c-9.1 9.1-23.7 9.3-33.1.7L95 201.1c-4.7-4.7-7-10.9-7-17s2.3-12.3 7-17c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l127.1 127z"></path></svg></div><div class="overflow-hidden transition-max-height duration-[0.5s] ease-in-out max-h-0"><div class="mt-2 text-gray-700 font-light max-w-5xl"><p class="mt-2 text-gray-700 font-light">Finlo is for investors who want to compound their wealth over the long term.</p></div></div></div><div class="mb-4 border-b border-gray-200 p-3"><div class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer"><h2 class="text-lg font">How often do I need to update my portfolio?</h2><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 512 512" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M256 294.1L383 167c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.3 24.6 0 34L273 345c-9.1 9.1-23.7 9.3-33.1.7L95 201.1c-4.7-4.7-7-10.9-7-17s2.3-12.3 7-17c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l127.1 127z"></path></svg></div><div class="overflow-hidden transition-max-height duration-[0.5s] ease-in-out max-h-0"><div class="mt-2 text-gray-700 font-light max-w-5xl"><p class="mt-2 text-gray-700 font-light">You will only need to update your portfolio once per month.</p></div></div></div><div class="mb-4 border-b border-gray-200 p-3"><div class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer"><h2 class="text-lg font">Will I need to spend a lot of time on this each month?</h2><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 512 512" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M256 294.1L383 167c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.3 24.6 0 34L273 345c-9.1 9.1-23.7 9.3-33.1.7L95 201.1c-4.7-4.7-7-10.9-7-17s2.3-12.3 7-17c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l127.1 127z"></path></svg></div><div class="overflow-hidden transition-max-height duration-[0.5s] ease-in-out max-h-0"><div class="mt-2 text-gray-700 font-light max-w-5xl"><p class="mt-2 text-gray-700 font-light">Not at all. You only need to take a few minutes each month to update your holdings through your brokerage account.</p></div></div></div><div class="mb-4 border-b border-gray-200 p-3"><div class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer"><h2 class="text-lg font">Does Finlo hold my money?</h2><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 512 512" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M256 294.1L383 167c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.3 24.6 0 34L273 345c-9.1 9.1-23.7 9.3-33.1.7L95 201.1c-4.7-4.7-7-10.9-7-17s2.3-12.3 7-17c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l127.1 127z"></path></svg></div><div class="overflow-hidden transition-max-height duration-[0.5s] ease-in-out max-h-0"><div class="mt-2 text-gray-700 font-light max-w-5xl"><p class="mt-2 text-gray-700 font-light">No, we do not hold your money. You are responsible for purchasing and managing your stock portfolio.</p></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-center mx-auto"><p class="text-sm text-gray-500 max-w-sm mx-auto">If you can&#x27;t find an answer to your question here, please contact us and we&#x27;ll be happy to help you.</p><a class="ring-1 ring-gray-700 text-black px-4 py-2 rounded-lg mt-4 mx-auto hover:bg-gray-700 hover:text-white" href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#1c7a75725c7a75727073327573">Contact Us</a></div></div></div><footer class="p-4 sm:p-6 m-4 mt-auto"><div class="mx-auto max-w-screen-xl"><div class="md:flex md:justify-between"><div class="mb-6 md:mb-0"><a class="flex items-center" href="https://finlo.io"><span class="self-center text-2xl font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">Finlo</span></a></div><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-8 sm:gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3"><div><h2 class="mb-6 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 uppercase">Company</h2><ul class="text-gray-600 text-sm"><li class="mb-4"><a class="hover:underline" href="/about">About Us</a></li><li><a class="hover:underline" href="/contact">Contact</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class="mb-6 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 uppercase">Legal</h2><ul class="text-gray-600 text-sm"><li class="mb-4"><a class="hover:underline" href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a></li><li><a class="hover:underline" href="/terms">Terms &amp; Conditions</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class="mb-6 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 uppercase">Follow us</h2><ul class="text-gray-600 text-sm"><li class="mb-4"><a class="hover:underline" href="https://x.com/finlo_io">Twitter</a></li><li><a class="hover:underline" href="https://www.facebook.com/finlo.io/">Facebook</a></li></ul></div></div></div><hr class="my-6 bor